{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI11WindowGroupV","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"conditions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of strings that OpenSwiftUI compares against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the incoming user activity or URL to see if OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can open a new scene instance to handle the external event."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"conditions"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene type that limits the kinds of external events for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When your app receives an external event like a user activity or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL, OpenSwiftUI routes the event to a scene for processing. OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects the scene that receives the event according to the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rules, which it evaluates in order until it finds a destination scene:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that support only a single scene per app, send"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event to the one open scene."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Find an open scene that indicates it prefers to or can handle the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, if any, and send the event to that scene. You use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on a view inside the scene to register this preference."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Find a scene declaration with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene modifier containing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"conditions"},{"type":"text","text":" that match the external event."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Create a new instance of the first scene that matches and route the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event there."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Find the first scene declaration that doesn’t have the scene modifier."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Create a new instance of this scene and route the event there."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make sure that at least one of these rules succeeds in your app for all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events that your app claims to handle. Also, make sure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the scene that receives an event actually handles it. For example,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sure that a scene that receives user activities handles them with an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appropriate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Don’t confuse the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},{"type":"text","text":" scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"view"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier. You use the scene modifier to help OpenSwiftUI choose a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new scene to open when no open scene handles an external event,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whereas you use the view modifier to indicate that an open scene can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or prefers to handle certain events."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Matching-an-event","text":"Matching an event","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find a scene type that handles a particular external event, OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compares a property of the event against the strings that you specify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"conditions"},{"type":"text","text":" set. OpenSwiftUI examines the following event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties to perform the comparison:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like when your app handles Handoff, OpenSwiftUI uses the activity’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/3238062-targetContentIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property, or if that’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property rendered as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like when another process opens a URL that your app handles,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI uses the URL’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty set of strings never matches. Similarly, empty strings never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"match. Conversely, as a special case, the string that contains only an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asterisk ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"type":"text","text":") matches anything. The modifier performs string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comparisons that are case and diacritic insensitive."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" scenes ignore this modifier. Instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document scenes decide whether to open a new scene to handle an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"external event by comparing the incoming URL or user activity’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the document group’s supported types."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","style":"important"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Choosing-a-window-to-open","text":"Choosing a window to open","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows an app with a photo browser scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that displays a collection of photos, and a photo detail scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enables closer examination of a particular photo:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyPhotos: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            PhotosBrowser()","        }","","        WindowGroup(\"Photo\") {","            PhotoDetail()","        }","        .handlesExternalEvents(matching: [\"photoIdentifier=\"])","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app uses the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second scene to ensure that an external event with an identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that contains the string "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"photoIdentifier="},{"type":"text","text":" creates a new scene of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the second type. Other events, if not handled by an open scene,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cause the creation of a new browser window instead."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the modified scene."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WindowGroup"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows."}],"title":"WindowGroup","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WindowGroup"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)","title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the modified scene."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"title":"Scene","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic"}}}